Alternatif flow context: npm i node-red-node-sqlite (di ~/.node-red), restart.

1. Tambah node 'sqlite' (database: iot.db, SQL Query: Via msg.topic).
2. Jalankan sekali (inject): CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS sensor_history (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT, suhu REAL, kelembaban REAL, ts TEXT, received TEXT);
3. Aktifkan node 'Siapkan INSERT SQLite' lalu sambungkan ke node sqlite.
4. Untuk GET /api/history, ganti sumber data dengan query:
SELECT suhu, kelembaban, ts AS timestamp, received FROM (SELECT * FROM sensor_history ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 50) ORDER BY id ASC;

